      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218894/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook, stirring occasionally, until thickened, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hKJt5XlhebIhTE-lzA6AZW7ftso=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218894_EaSywedishMeatballSauce_mfs_step3_4x3-66201214515e45a3814a1768471c9dfc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218894/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in thawed meatballs, and continue cooking until meatballs are heated through, about 5 more minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center of the meatballs should read at least 160 degrees F (71 degrees C).",
